WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,600
He's three years old and it's really time to sleep on his own

2
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,010
Buy 200 bottles of coffee first

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:10,030
Successfully purchased 200 bottles of super coffee

4
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,230
Stored in warehouse

5
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,470
You are Lin Yu

6
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:19,860
It's really you, Monitor Lin

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,260
We haven’t seen each other since graduation, right?

8
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,860
I didn't expect to meet you here

9
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,690
Yeah, quite a coincidence

10
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,890
I didn't expect you, Lin Yu, to open a supermarket here.

11
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,290
Then we will keep in touch in the future.

12
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:30,690
The coffee shop opposite that is being renovated is owned by me.

13
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,090
My mother insisted that I start a business

14
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,290
I think the location here is good

15
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,090
I just wanted to open a coffee shop, what do you think?

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,710
I feel very bad

17
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,110
The Pinzhuang coffee in my supermarket sells very well.

18
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,110
People come to buy every day

19
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,710
While the store is still there
